#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""budicek: Buddy's wake-up service for delegated bot work.

Buddy never waits on a bot synchronously. `budicek zadej` records the
delegation, prepares the way its wake goes and starts the bot in MausBot.
`budicek hlidej` (a systemd user service) pulls the state of every open
delegation from MausBot and, on any outcome (done, failed, question, missed
deadline, MausBot down), wakes Buddy in the conversation the delegation came
from: in his chat in Lazurio (T3 Code, channel `t3`) a budíček message in his
one thread; otherwise a Hermes Kanban card with a `wake` subscription, which
Hermes delivers to his Telegram conversation. Buddy acknowledges with
`budicek potvrd`; without an acknowledgement the service wakes him again (at
most twice) and then messages the user directly.

All state lives on disk, one JSON file per delegation, written atomically, so
the service survives its own restart. Standard library only.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

